M(3,'Public-enterprise autonomy necessarily means the enterprise has been sold to private owners. This statement is:', ['True in every case','False; autonomy can expand while public ownership remains','True only for schools','The definition of a tariff'],1,'Managerial autonomy and ownership transfer are distinct.')
